@prefix skos:   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix naics:  <http://qb.intuit.com/naics/> .
@prefix unspsc: <http://qb.intuit.com/unspsc/> .

# ============================================================
# CROSS-TAXONOMY LINKS — NAICS ↔ UNSPSC
#
# These are the links that make the agent smarter than flat
# string matching. When NAICS sectors differ, query_ontology
# checks if there's a shared commodity that connects them.
#
# skos:related is symmetric (owl:SymmetricProperty in SKOS spec),
# so naics:X skos:related unspsc:Y implies the reverse via
# RDFS-Plus reasoning.
# ============================================================

# --- KEY DEMO LINK: Plumbing contractor ↔ Plumbing wholesaler ---
#
# NAICS 238220 (Plumbing Contractor, sector 23)
# NAICS 423720 (Plumbing Wholesaler, sector 42)
# Connected via: UNSPSC 72151500 (Plumbing Services)
#                UNSPSC 40141600 (Pipe Fittings)
#
# This is the canonical example from the design doc:
# "Wholesaler supplies what contractor installs"

naics:238220 skos:related unspsc:72151500 .   # contractor PROVIDES plumbing services
naics:238220 skos:related unspsc:40141600 .   # contractor PROCURES pipe fittings
naics:238220 skos:related unspsc:40141800 .   # contractor PROCURES plumbing supplies
naics:238220 skos:related unspsc:40151500 .   # contractor installs water heaters

naics:423720 skos:related unspsc:40141600 .   # wholesaler SELLS pipe fittings
naics:423720 skos:related unspsc:40141700 .   # wholesaler SELLS valves
naics:423720 skos:related unspsc:40141800 .   # wholesaler SELLS plumbing supplies
naics:423720 skos:related unspsc:40151500 .   # wholesaler SELLS water heaters
naics:423720 skos:related unspsc:72151500 .   # wholesaler serves plumbing services sector

# --- Electrical contractor ↔ Electrical suppliers ---

naics:238210 skos:related unspsc:72141000 .   # electrical contractor PROVIDES installation
naics:238210 skos:related unspsc:39121000 .   # contractor PROCURES wire
naics:238210 skos:related unspsc:39 .         # contractor PROCURES electrical equipment

# --- Construction ↔ Building materials ---

naics:236110 skos:related unspsc:72111000 .   # residential builder PROVIDES construction services
naics:236110 skos:related unspsc:30111600 .   # builder PROCURES lumber
naics:236110 skos:related unspsc:30121500 .   # builder PROCURES concrete

naics:236220 skos:related unspsc:72112000 .   # commercial builder PROVIDES construction services
naics:236220 skos:related unspsc:30111600 .   # builder PROCURES lumber
naics:236220 skos:related unspsc:30121500 .   # builder PROCURES concrete

# --- Lumber/materials wholesaler ↔ Construction ---

naics:423310 skos:related unspsc:30111600 .   # lumber wholesaler SELLS lumber
naics:423310 skos:related unspsc:30 .         # wholesaler serves building materials

naics:423320 skos:related unspsc:30121500 .   # masonry wholesaler SELLS concrete/stone
naics:423320 skos:related unspsc:30 .         # wholesaler serves building materials

# --- Home center retail ↔ Various trades ---

naics:444110 skos:related unspsc:40141600 .   # home center SELLS pipe fittings
naics:444110 skos:related unspsc:39121000 .   # home center SELLS electrical wire
naics:444110 skos:related unspsc:30111600 .   # home center SELLS lumber
naics:444110 skos:related unspsc:40141800 .   # home center SELLS plumbing supplies

# --- Painting contractor ↔ Paint retail ---

naics:238320 skos:related unspsc:72121000 .   # painting contractor PROVIDES painting services
naics:444120 skos:related unspsc:72121000 .   # paint store serves painting services sector

# --- Food service ↔ Food products ---

naics:722511 skos:related unspsc:90101500 .   # restaurant PROVIDES restaurant services
naics:722511 skos:related unspsc:50 .         # restaurant PROCURES food products
naics:722513 skos:related unspsc:90101500 .   # limited-service restaurant PROVIDES services
naics:722513 skos:related unspsc:50 .         # restaurant PROCURES food products

# --- Auto repair ↔ Auto parts (no link to plumbing!) ---
# This is the NEGATIVE test case: auto repair should NOT
# relate to plumbing via cross-taxonomy.

naics:811111 skos:related unspsc:90 .         # auto repair — only links to its own domain

# ============================================================
# INTRA-TAXONOMY RELATEDNESS — NAICS ↔ NAICS
#
# Some NAICS codes in different sectors are closely related
# but have no direct hierarchical link. skos:related captures
# "these industries commonly interact" relationships.
# ============================================================

# Plumbing contractors often work with electrical contractors
naics:238220 skos:related naics:238210 .

# Residential builders subcontract to specialty trades
naics:236110 skos:related naics:238220 .
naics:236110 skos:related naics:238210 .
naics:236110 skos:related naics:238320 .
naics:236110 skos:related naics:238330 .

# Construction material wholesalers serve construction
naics:423310 skos:related naics:236110 .
naics:423320 skos:related naics:236110 .
